  "noteAdaptiveDetail": "Its endpoint is adaptive rather than asynchronous, so it adapts to the rate the phone sends instead of running its own clock and asking the phone to follow. Common on UAC1 hardware. Samples still arrive unaltered; the timing reference is simply the phone's.",
  "@noteAdaptiveDetail": {
    "description": "Explains adaptive versus asynchronous USB timing, and reassures that the audio data itself is unchanged either way."
